INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'For the Light! For Azeroth!', 0),
(41198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This silence. I\'d never thought it would be so exhilarating. Finally, after all these years of horror and agony, I feel the burden of my death being lifted off me. My eternal gratitude upon you, kindest of strangers!', 0),
(41199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Leonid takes the derelict mace and gazes upon it almost sentimentally.>$B$BI remember that day... and the horrors it bore. Without the supervision of the Silver Hand, the summit turned slowly into a nest of sinistry and soon sunk into the clutches of darkness. The Cult of the Damned infiltrated the refugees of Stratholme seeking shelter in the mountains and overthrew Arthas\' old stronghold after Uther left.$B$BAs a devout disciple of the Light I did all I could to protect the innocent. Foolish, perhaps, but anything else would\'ve been shameful to me. With life fading my ravaged body, the last sounds I heard were the screams of fear and agony coming from the people I failed to save.$B$BThank you for bringing this to me, traveler. It was a choice reminder of the terrors the Scourge inflicts upon the world, one neither you nor I should easily forget.', 0),
(41200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Light shines brighter today. Through your conviction, evil has been held back for now. Do not foolishly think this to be the end of it. Darkness is rarely ever extinguished fully. Stay vigilant, adventurer, and may the Light shine upon you.', 0),
(60065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Have you fulfilled Mal\'adris\' last request? You are sadly too late. He succumbed to his injuries not long ago; I did everything I could to save his life, but it was not enough. Us members of the Argent Dawn are well aware of what our duty in these lands entails, yet when the time eventually comes for every one of us, rarely do they come to terms with it. I\'ve seen it countless times, and it never gets any more bearable.$B$BLet this be a warning to you, adventurer. Should you still wish to venture into the abyss that awaits you beyond this hill, then be well aware. Death awaits at every corner.', 0),
(80709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We’ve been expecting at least a handful of new recruits, not just one.$B$BExplain yourself immediately.', 0),
(80710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Perfect condition, if anything this rotten could be called something other than disgusting.$B$BBlasted Scourge, I hope the High General is right.$B$BNow onto your next task, recruit.', 0),
(80711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Welcome back, brother and may the Light bless us both in the days to come.$B$BHere’s your insignia and here’s the map for the entrance, the High General will be very pleased to have you.$B$BFor the Scarlet Crusade, for the Light and for Lordaeron!', 0),
(80729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, another recruit, what took you so long to get here?', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40221, 0, 0, 'Go forth, champion!', 0),
(41198, 0, 0, 'Please, the voices...! There are too many of them!', 0),
(41199, 0, 0, 'What is it, $R? What can the Argent Dawn do for a traveler like you?', 0),
(41200, 0, 0, 'The Brotherhood of Light will not stand idly by while villainy is free to set its course. Righteousness will prevail.', 0),
(60065, 0, 0, 'You\'ve returned...', 0),
(80709, 0, 0, 'Speak quickly or move along.', 0),
(80710, 0, 0, 'Don’t worry yourself with details, do as you were told.', 0),
(80711, 0, 0, 'It’s a simple task, kill and collect, what more do you want?', 0),
(80729, 0, 0, 'Speak quickly or move along.', 0);
